### Invalid Concept

#### Metadata
  * type: concept
  * concept_kind: concept
  * pref_label: Invalid Concept Label

#### Relations
  * derivedFrom: [Invalid Concept Scheme](#invalid-concept-scheme)

#### Definition
Concepts must use the main body, not Definition.

#### Details
Concepts must use the main body, not Details.
