### Invalid Structural Ontology

#### Metadata
  * type: ontology
  * ontology_base: https://example.test/invalid-structural
  * ontology_prefix: invalidstructural

#### Ontology
```turtle
@prefix invalidstructural: <https://example.test/invalid-structural#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

invalidstructural:Thing a owl:Class .
```
