### Invalid Cross Scheme Broader Concept

Concept that incorrectly uses broader across concept schemes.

#### Metadata
  * type: concept

#### Relations
  * derivedFrom: [Invalid Concept Scheme](#invalid-concept-scheme)
  * broader: [Cross Scheme Parent Concept](#cross-scheme-parent-concept)
---

### Invalid Cross Scheme Narrower Concept

Concept that incorrectly uses narrower across concept schemes.

