### Valid Cross Scheme Association Concept

Concept that may intentionally associate with concepts in another scheme.

#### Metadata
  * type: concept

#### Relations
  * derivedFrom: [Invalid Concept Scheme](#invalid-concept-scheme)
  * related: [Cross Scheme Parent Concept](#cross-scheme-parent-concept)
  * exactMatch: [Cross Scheme Parent Concept](#cross-scheme-parent-concept)
  * closeMatch: [Cross Scheme Parent Concept](#cross-scheme-parent-concept)
